{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/1602c50713894a2bb1d11c396107822a.avif?t=1756323486\" width=600 height=143 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COMPETE IN FAST-PACED ONLINE 1v1 BATTLES</strong></h2>Take turns launching attacks by creating color-matching formations. Vertical matches create attackers, horizontal ones defenders. Rapid-fire matches are 5 minutes and gameplay is simple to jump into. Endless depth of strategy emerges with advanced play. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/5314bfa9948aa4aac329dca953737872.poster.avif?t=1756323486\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/5314bfa9948aa4aac329dca953737872.webm?t=1756323486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/5314bfa9948aa4aac329dca953737872.mp4?t=1756323486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RECRUIT NEW UNITS WITH UNIQUE ABILITIES</strong></h2>Climb the intergalactic ranks and discover a giant roster of units with unique abilities. Choose between multiple teams bursting with style. Recruit charismatic captains who run the playfield with big personalities and tide-turning special abilities. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/0c68b1590cae18f49f5045811036d31b.poster.avif?t=1756323486\" width=612 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/0c68b1590cae18f49f5045811036d31b.webm?t=1756323486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/0c68b1590cae18f49f5045811036d31b.mp4?t=1756323486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TAILOR THE GAME EXPERIENCE</strong></h2>Fierce competition requires fierce customization. Ascend the win ladder and discover show-stopping new looks for your captains, expressive emojis and custom win screens to taunt your rivals, and surprises along the way. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/ef8c169339a0041fc7d7d870563c31bc.poster.avif?t=1756323486\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/ef8c169339a0041fc7d7d870563c31bc.webm?t=1756323486\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/ef8c169339a0041fc7d7d870563c31bc.mp4?t=1756323486\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE THE COMMUNITY</strong></h2>BVN is a live game with new seasonal twists, characters, rankings and challenges. Teams spend a season vying for the Champion title\u2013and the player community decides who takes the crown! Win a match with the Rag Tags team? That win shapes the stats, outcome, and narrative events of the season for everyone.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/extras/7bdba31a0c9bdafde456103ac694c0ff.avif?t=1756323486\" width=600 height=80 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2216850?t=1756323486","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216850/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756323486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2216